*** These test cases test things related to lexing and parsing.
***
*** List of things currently being tested:
*** - Integer literals of the following formats/bases work:
***   - Decimal.
***   - Hexadecimal.
***   - Binary.
*** - Whitespaces and comments work.
*** - Labels work.
*** - Valid register indices work.


*** Decimal integer literals ***

  $ assembler ../examples/lexer_parser/decimal.gsm --format ascii -o decimal-ascii
  Wrote: decimal-ascii
  $ cat decimal-ascii
  00100000000000000000100000101010
  00100000000000000001011111010110
  00000000000100000001100001001010
  00000000000100000010000010110110


*** Hexadecimal integer literals ***

  $ assembler ../examples/lexer_parser/hexadecimal.gsm --format ascii -o hexadecimal-ascii
  Wrote: hexadecimal-ascii
  $ cat hexadecimal-ascii
  00100000000000000000100000101010
  00100000000000000001011111010110
  00100000000000000001100000101010
  00100000000000000010011111010110


*** Binary integer literals ***

